statement.p:
Match the surfaces with the verbal description of the level curves by placing
the letter of the verbal description to the left of the number of the surface.




z = \sqrt{(x^2 + y^2)}




z = xy




z = \sqrt{(25 - x^2 - y^2)}




z = x^2 + y^2




z = 2x + 3y




z = 2x^2 + 3y^2




z = \frac{1}{x-1}
